## Interface: 16001
## Title: Pace's Quality of Life
## Notes: Small conveniences for WoW Forever: track or untrack every quest (or a whole zone) from the quest log, filter Looking For Group players by role, a quest tracker that follows your zone, and who's in a community voice channel before you join it. Each can be switched off.
